---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Facebook TAO's data model (Bronson et al., USENIX ATC 2013) on a small made-up example:
// typed objects (nodes) and typed, directed associations (edges) on top, and the two MySQL
// tables they map to underneath. Associations live on the shard of id1, so all edges going out
// of one object are answered by one server. Arrowheads are polygons: no SVG ids.

const W = 900;
const H = 598;

type Obj = { id: number; key: string; name: string; nameVi: string; otype: string; x: number; y: number };
const nodeW = 150;
const nodeH = 52;
const objs: Obj[] = [
  { id: 101, key: 'mai', name: 'Mai', nameVi: 'Mai', otype: 'user', x: 40, y: 72 },
  { id: 102, key: 'tom', name: 'Tom', nameVi: 'Tom', otype: 'user', x: 40, y: 214 },
  { id: 301, key: 'photo', name: 'Photo', nameVi: 'Ảnh', otype: 'photo', x: 380, y: 72 },
  { id: 402, key: 'comment', name: '"Nice shot!"', nameVi: '"Ảnh đẹp!"', otype: 'comment', x: 380, y: 214 },
  { id: 501, key: 'place', name: 'Hoi An', nameVi: 'Hội An', otype: 'place', x: 710, y: 72 },
];

type Edge = { x1: number; y1: number; x2: number; y2: number; label?: string; lx?: number; ly?: number; anchor?: string };
const edges: Edge[] = [
  { x1: 190, y1: 92, x2: 380, y2: 92, label: 'AUTHORED', lx: 285, ly: 84, anchor: 'middle' },
  { x1: 530, y1: 98, x2: 710, y2: 98, label: 'TAKEN_AT', lx: 620, ly: 90, anchor: 'middle' },
  { x1: 455, y1: 124, x2: 455, y2: 214, label: 'COMMENT', lx: 465, ly: 174, anchor: 'start' },
  { x1: 190, y1: 246, x2: 380, y2: 246, label: 'AUTHORED', lx: 285, ly: 238, anchor: 'middle' },
  { x1: 190, y1: 222, x2: 380, y2: 112, label: 'LIKES', lx: 300, ly: 172, anchor: 'start' },
  { x1: 62, y1: 124, x2: 62, y2: 214 },
  { x1: 84, y1: 214, x2: 84, y2: 124 },
];

// Arrowhead at (x2, y2), pointing along the edge; the line stops at the arrow's base.
function arrow(e: Edge, len = 10, half = 5) {
  const dx = e.x2 - e.x1;
  const dy = e.y2 - e.y1;
  const d = Math.hypot(dx, dy);
  const ux = dx / d;
  const uy = dy / d;
  const bx = e.x2 - ux * len;
  const by = e.y2 - uy * len;
  return {
    line: { x2: bx, y2: by },
    points: `${e.x2},${e.y2} ${bx - uy * half},${by + ux * half} ${bx + uy * half},${by - ux * half}`,
  };
}

const objRows = objs.map((o) => [String(o.id), o.otype, o.otype === 'user' || o.otype === 'place' ? `name: ${o.name}` : o.otype === 'comment' ? 'text: Nice shot!' : 'url: …']);
const assocRows: [string, string, string][] = [
  ['101', 'AUTHORED', '301'],
  ['102', 'AUTHORED', '402'],
  ['102', 'LIKES', '301'],
  ['301', 'COMMENT', '402'],
  ['301', 'TAKEN_AT', '501'],
  ['101', 'FRIEND', '102'],
  ['102', 'FRIEND', '101'],
];
const tTop = 340;
const rowH = 24;
const objCols = [{ x: 20, w: 64 }, { x: 84, w: 92 }, { x: 176, w: 224 }];
const asCols = [{ x: 470, w: 70 }, { x: 540, w: 140 }, { x: 680, w: 70 }];
---
<figure class="dmtao">
  <div class="dmtao-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Five objects, two users, a photo, a comment and a place, linked by typed directed edges: AUTHORED, LIKES, COMMENT, TAKEN_AT and FRIEND stored in both directions. Below, the same data as two MySQL tables: objects with id, type and data, and associations with id1, type and id2.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="dmtao-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>What the app sees: typed objects and typed edges</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thứ app nhìn thấy: object có kiểu và cạnh có kiểu</tspan>
    </text>

    {edges.map((e) => {
      const a = arrow(e);
      return (
        <g>
          <line x1={e.x1} y1={e.y1} x2={a.line.x2} y2={a.line.y2} class="dmtao-edge" />
          <polygon points={a.points} class="dmtao-head" />
          {e.label && <text x={e.lx} y={e.ly} text-anchor={e.anchor} class="dmtao-elabel">{e.label}</text>}
        </g>
      );
    })}
    <text x="98" y="164" class="dmtao-elabel">FRIEND</text>
    <text x="98" y="184" class="dmtao-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>(2 rows)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>(2 dòng)</tspan>
    </text>

    {objs.map((o) => (
      <g class={o.id === 301 ? 'dmtao-obj is-hot' : 'dmtao-obj'}>
        <rect x={o.x} y={o.y} width={nodeW} height={nodeH} rx="4" />
        <DiagramIcon name={o.otype === 'user' ? 'user' : o.otype === 'comment' ? 'mail' : 'file'} x={o.x + nodeW - 22} y={o.y + nodeH / 2} size={20} />
        <text x={o.x + 12} y={o.y + 22} class="dmtao-name">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{o.name}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{o.nameVi}</tspan>
        </text>
        <text x={o.x + 12} y={o.y + 42} class="dmtao-type">{o.otype} · {o.id}</text>
      </g>
    ))}

    <text x="600" y="196" class="dmtao-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Any edge type can link</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cạnh kiểu nào cũng nối được</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="600" y="216" class="dmtao-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>any two objects. A schema</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>hai object bất kỳ. Schema chỉ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="600" y="236" class="dmtao-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>only lists each type's fields.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>liệt kê các trường của từng kiểu.</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="296" y2="296" class="dmtao-rule" />
    <DiagramIcon name="mysql" x={32} y={319} size={22} />
    <text x="52" y="324" class="dmtao-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>What MySQL stores: one table of objects, one of associations</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thứ MySQL lưu: một bảng object, một bảng association</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* objects table */}
    {['id', 'otype', 'data'].map((h, i) => (
      <text x={objCols[i].x + 8} y={tTop + 17} class="dmtao-th">{h}</text>
    ))}
    {objRows.map((r, ri) => {
      const y = tTop + rowH * (ri + 1);
      return (
        <g class={r[0] === '301' ? 'dmtao-row is-hot' : 'dmtao-row'}>
          <rect x="20" y={y} width="380" height={rowH} />
          {r.map((c, ci) => <text x={objCols[ci].x + 8} y={y + 17}>{c}</text>)}
        </g>
      );
    })}

    {/* associations table */}
    {['id1', 'atype', 'id2'].map((h, i) => (
      <text x={asCols[i].x + 8} y={tTop + 17} class="dmtao-th">{h}</text>
    ))}
    <text x="760" y={tTop + 17} class="dmtao-th">
      <tspan data-lang-en>+ time, data</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>+ time, data</tspan>
    </text>
    {assocRows.map((r, ri) => {
      const y = tTop + rowH * (ri + 1);
      return (
        <g class={r[0] === '301' ? 'dmtao-row is-hot' : 'dmtao-row'}>
          <rect x="470" y={y} width="410" height={rowH} />
          {r.map((c, ci) => <text x={asCols[ci].x + 8} y={y + 17}>{c}</text>)}
        </g>
      );
    })}

    <text x="470" y={tTop + rowH * 8 + 26} class="dmtao-note is-hot">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Each row lives on the shard of its id1, so one server</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi dòng nằm trên shard của id1, nên một server</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="470" y={tTop + rowH * 8 + 46} class="dmtao-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>answers "every edge out of photo 301".</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>trả lời được "mọi cạnh đi ra từ ảnh 301".</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y={tTop + rowH * 6 + 26} class="dmtao-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>All object types share this one table.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mọi kiểu object dùng chung một bảng này.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>An example in the shape of TAO's model: objects are typed nodes, associations are typed directed edges, and a two-way relationship such as FRIEND is two rows. The model and the shard rule are from the 2013 TAO paper.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Ví dụ theo đúng hình dạng mô hình của TAO: object là đỉnh có kiểu, association là cạnh có hướng và có kiểu, quan hệ hai chiều như FRIEND là hai dòng. Mô hình và quy tắc chia shard lấy từ bài báo TAO năm 2013.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dmtao {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .dmtao-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .dmtao svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .dmtao text {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .dmtao .dmtao-h {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .dmtao-rule {
    stroke: var(--border);
  }
  .dmtao-edge {
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.4;
  }
  .dmtao-head {
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .dmtao .dmtao-elabel {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .dmtao-obj rect {
    fill: var(--bg-alt);
    stroke: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .dmtao-obj.is-hot rect {
    fill: var(--red-tint-bg);
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
  }
  .dmtao .dmtao-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .dmtao .dmtao-type {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .dmtao .dmtao-th {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .dmtao-row rect {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--border);
  }
  .dmtao-row.is-hot rect {
    fill: var(--red-tint-bg);
  }
  .dmtao .dmtao-row text {
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .dmtao .dmtao-note {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .dmtao .dmtao-note.is-hot {
    fill: var(--red);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .dmtao figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
